# Pipeline Idempotency & Schema Evolution

You are operating within the `{{project_name}}` data platform workspace.

## 1. Deterministic Transforms
Pipeline tasks must be idempotent: executing a pipeline task multiple times with the same input parameters and input data partition must yield identical results without duplicate side-effects.

## 2. Schema Validation
All data ingress and egress points must validate against declared schemas. Breaking schema changes require explicit migration scripts and version increments.
